#: data/io.github.H4ck70r.Veintiuno.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Veintiuno is a complete blackjack table for your desktop. Play against the "
"dealer with the real casino rules, keep track of your bankroll and sharpen "
"your game."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.H4ck70r.Veintiuno.metainfo.xml.in:15
msgid "Features:"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.H4ck70r.Veintiuno.metainfo.xml.in:17
msgid ""
"Hit, stand, double down, split up to four hands, surrender and insurance"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.H4ck70r.Veintiuno.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid ""
"Configurable rules: 1 to 8 decks, dealer hits or stands on soft 17, 3:2 or "
"6:5 payouts, double after split, resplitting aces, European no-hole-card "
"game and more"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.H4ck70r.Veintiuno.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Ready-made rule presets and a live house-edge estimate"
