#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:65
msgid "Goal"
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:66
msgid ""
"Beat the dealer by finishing closer to 21 without going over. Number cards "
"count their value, faces count 10 and aces count 1 or 11."
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:69
msgid ""
"An ace with a ten-value card as your first two cards is a blackjack. It pays "
"3 to 2 (or 6 to 5 if the table says so) unless the dealer also has one."
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:71
msgid "Your Options"
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:72
msgid ""
"Hit takes another card. Stand keeps your total. Double doubles your bet and "
"gives you exactly one more card. Split turns a pair into two hands with a "
"bet each. Surrender gives up the hand and returns half the bet; it is only "
"available as your first decision."
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:76 src/veintiuno/ui/preferences.py:112
#: src/veintiuno/ui/table.py:349
msgid "Insurance"
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:77
msgid ""
"When the dealer shows an ace you may bet half your wager that the dealer has "
"blackjack. It pays 2 to 1. Basic strategy never takes insurance."
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:79
msgid "The Dealer"
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:80
msgid ""
"The dealer has no choices: draws until reaching 17 or more, and on some "
"tables also hits a soft 17 (a 17 counting an ace as 11)."
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:82 src/veintiuno/ui/preferences.py:63
msgid "Training"
msgstr ""

#: src/veintiuno/ui/help.py:83
msgid ""
"Turn on the strategy coach to be told when a play differs from basic "
"strategy, press ? for a hint, and enable the card count to practise Hi-Lo "
"counting: 2–6 count +1, 7–9 count 0, tens and aces count −1. The true count "
"is the running count divided by the decks left in the shoe."
msgstr ""

